{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Street Basket Challenge is a 2-on-2 SD-style basketball game featuring charismatic characters and a gameplay system inspired by classic arcade beat \u2019em ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As usual for the series, traditional sports rules don\u2019t apply. Players can steal the ball from opponents by any means necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each team has a basket on three different backboards\u2014high, medium, and low. Once a basket receives enough points, it breaks off the backboard. You can pick it up and repair it\u2026 or take it and attach it to your opponent\u2019s board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stages include unique features such as traps and boost zones, and each character comes equipped with distinct abilities, special techniques, and powerful super shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also includes a full tournament mode where players can level up, unlock improvements, and customize their playstyle. With a wide variety of stages, items, teams, characters, and special shots, Street Basket Challenge offers a deep and chaotic arcade-style experience with plenty of replay value.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Super Shot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2305990/37c1b57ab5dd024e800b23124aaff46fbe9c6db9.jpg"},{"name":"Slam Dunk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2305990/8c56211d1b3ede9af5ebc6785ce5bc11f8081cc2.jpg"},{"name":"Winner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2305990/8e9886555723e0147fff8de188fc373b138dab2f.jpg"},{"name":"Bronze Medal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2305990/3a4fffca1807ac0b0ae876fc7c39289e904538b2.jpg"},{"name":"Silver Medal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/pub